{"data":{"product":{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/7537109991521","title":"Willow Mist Mommy and Me Dresses - Floral Hem Sundress","handle":"willow-mist-mommy-and-me-dresses","status":"ACTIVE","publishedAt":"2026-04-24T17:17:01Z","onlineStoreUrl":"https://www.dresslikemommy.com/products/willow-mist-mommy-and-me-dresses","descriptionHtml":"<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven polyester with a soft drape that feels airy, floaty, and photo-ready on warm days.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A picture-perfect matching dress moment for mom and daughter, made for garden parties, picnic photos, birthdays, and vacation afternoons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> \"Willow Mist\" comes in White or Green, both finished with soft blue-green soft floral hems for a playful summer look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Shoulder tie straps, square neckline, sheer overlay, smocked back, gently gathered waist, and a twirl-friendly midi skirt that moves beautifully with every step.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and use a cool iron inside-out if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Girls Child 4 Years to Child 12 Years; Mother S to Mother L.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Skirt Length (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>110 cm / 43.3 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2 in</td>\n<td>62.5 cm / 24.6 in</td>\n<td>73.5 cm / 28.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>66.5 cm / 26.2 in</td>\n<td>62.5 cm / 24.6 in</td>\n<td>73.5 cm / 28.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>130 cm / 51.2 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>140 cm / 55.1 in</td>\n<td>69.5 cm / 27.4 in</td>\n<td>82.5 cm / 32.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>73.5 cm / 28.9 in</td>\n<td>69.5 cm / 27.4 in</td>\n<td>82.5 cm / 32.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>150 cm / 59.1 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n<td>87 cm / 34.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>77 cm / 30.3 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n<td>87 cm / 34.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 12 Years</td>\n<td>11-12</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>160 cm / 63.0 in</td>\n<td>76.5 cm / 30.1 in</td>\n<td>91.5 cm / 36.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>80.5 cm / 31.7 in</td>\n<td>76.5 cm / 30.1 in</td>\n<td>91.5 cm / 36.0 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>165 cm / 65.0 in</td>\n<td>80.5 cm / 31.7 in</td>\n<td>103.5 cm / 40.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86.5 cm / 34.1 in</td>\n<td>78.5 cm / 30.9 in</td>\n<td>103.5 cm / 40.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>170 cm / 66.9 in</td>\n<td>84.5 cm / 33.3 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>90.5 cm / 35.6 in</td>\n<td>82.5 cm / 32.5 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>175 cm / 68.9 in</td>\n<td>88.5 cm / 34.8 in</td>\n<td>112.5 cm / 44.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>94.5 cm / 37.2 in</td>\n<td>86.5 cm / 34.1 in</td>\n<td>112.5 cm / 44.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Willow Mist Mommy and Me Dresses bring a soft picnic-ready feel to matching family style. The sheer overlay and blue-green floral hem brighten the silhouette, while the square neckline and shoulder ties give mom and mini a polished sunny-day look.</p>\n\n<p>From park strolls to vacation dinners, the tie straps and gathered skirt keep the dress looking dressed up while still feeling light and easy to wear. The side-tie waist and twirl-friendly shape make it an easy pick for portraits, birthdays, and every sunny plan in between.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Two color options:</strong> Choose White or Green, each with a delicate floral hem for a fresh, garden-inspired finish.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tie-strap neckline:</strong> Shoulder ties and a square neckline add a sweet dress-up finish for mom and mini.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sleeveless summer shape:</strong> Tie straps and an airy bodice keep the silhouette sweet and warm-weather friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy gathered skirt:</strong> The relaxed midi shape moves beautifully for parties, vacations, and portraits.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini matching:</strong> Coordinated mother-and-daughter styling makes family dressing feel effortless.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your sizes and bring home a matching floral-hem sundress set that feels ready for every warm-weather memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Child 11-12yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Dresses","Floral Hem","Garden Floral","Girl Dress","Green","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1044105977372.html","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Dresses","Midi Dress","Midi Dresses","Mom Size L","Mom Size M","Mom Size S","Mommy and Me","Mother Dress","Picnic","Resort","Ruffle Trim","Summer","Sundress","Sundresses","Tie Strap Dress","Vacation","White","Willow Mist"],"seo":{"title":"Willow Mist Matching Dresses | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Lightweight woven mommy-and-me dresses for mom + daughter in white or green. Sizes 4Y-12Y and Mom S-L with floral hems."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-4","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > Dresses"},"variants"